      407.7,
      295.11,
      462.78
    ],
    "text": "I, Munasingha Kariyawasam Appuhamilage Don SomadasaGunawardana, Minister of Lands hereby declare, under Sub-section(1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land describedbelow is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      475.38,
      295.13,
      553.26
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called \u2018\u2018Govinnehena\u2019\u2019 in total extent ofAbout 0.0335 Hectare, described in the Amended Advance TracingNo. Maha/TMP/2014/627 dated 20th June, 2015, prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated at the Village of Niyambepola inUdapalatha Korale - East Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019sDivision of Thumpane in Kandy District, Central Province andbounded as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
